## 5. Verification & Log Deliverables

The application produces three primary log files during runtime:

1. **`logs/<username>/activity_log_<username>.jsonl`**:
   Contains user interaction session data (keystrokes, mouse distance, active window titles, process names, timestamps).
2. **`logs/<username>/network_log_<username>.jsonl`**:
   Contains active network connection sessions (local/remote IP & ports, PID, process name, bytes sent/received, classified protocol, domain).
3. **`network_logger_debug.txt`**:
   Detailed diagnostic log recording ETW session startup, ProcessTrace thread status, and event parsing sizes.

